      "message": "Nit readibility:\n\nI believe we could have an external method that does most of the job like this:\n(up to you to pass eq(CONNECT) in parameter or enforce it for everyone)\n\n```\n    @SafeVarargs\n    private void verifyIntentSent(Matcher\u003cIntent\u003e... matchers) {\n        mInOrder.verify(mBassClientService)\n                .sendBroadcast(\n                        MockitoHamcrest.argThat(AllOf.allOf(matchers)), eq(BLUETOOTH_CONNECT) any());\n    }\n```\n\nThat make the code to check for a specific action way smaller (and then this can be re-used anytime an intent is checked)\n\n```suggestion\n            verifyIntentSent(\n                    hasAction(BluetoothLeBroadcastAssistant.ACTION_CONNECTION_STATE_CHANGED),\n                    hasFlag(\n                            Intent.FLAG_RECEIVER_REGISTERED_ONLY_BEFORE_BOOT\n                                    | Intent.FLAG_RECEIVER_INCLUDE_BACKGROUND));\n```",
